+MeteorFalls_B1F_2R_Text_StevenChallenge:
+	.string "STEVEN: Oh, wow, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
+	.string "I'm amazed you knew where to find me.\p"
+	.string "Do you, uh…maybe think of me as\n"
+	.string "just a rock maniac?\p"
+	.string "No, that can't be right.\p"
+	.string "We battled alongside each other at\n"
+	.string "the SOOTOPOLIS SPACE CENTER.\p"
+	.string "You should have a very good idea\n"
+	.string "about how good I am.\p"
+	.string "Okay, {PLAYER}{KUN}, if you're going to mount\n"
+	.string "a serious challenge, expect the worst!$"
+
+MeteorFalls_B1F_2R_Text_StevenDefeat:
+	.string "You…\n"
+	.string "I had no idea you'd become so strong…$"
+
+MeteorFalls_B1F_2R_Text_StevenPrediction:
+	.string "STEVEN: Come to think of it, ever since\n"
+	.string "our paths first crossed in GRANITE\l"
+	.string "CAVE in DEWFORD, I had this feeling.\p"
+	.string "I thought that you would eventually\n"
+	.string "become the CHAMPION.\p"
+	.string "My predictions usually come true.\p"
+	.string "And where will you go from here?\p"
+	.string "… … … … … …\n"
+	.string "… … … … … …\p"
+	.string "Fufufu, even I couldn't tell you that.$"
+
+MeteorFalls_B1F_2R_Text_StevenCosmicHint:
+	.string "STEVEN: Oh, yes. If you're here, then\n"
+	.string "perhaps you've heard it too.\p"
+	.string "The SPACE CENTER registers a faint\n"
+	.string "signal from deep within these falls.\p"
+	.string "I've analyzed it. It is no mere\n"
+	.string "geology. It ebbs and flows like\l"
+	.string "COSMIC POWER, the move that draws\n"
+	.string "strength from space itself.\p"
+	.string "And those marks on the wall there…\n"
+	.string "The sun, and the moon.\p"
+	.string "What a stone might wish for,\n"
+	.string "even I couldn't tell you.$"
+
+MeteorFalls_B1F_2R_Text_Marks:
+	.string "It's a bulge in the rock wall.\p"
+	.string "Ancient marks are cut deep into\n"
+	.string "the stone: a radiant circle,\l"
+	.string "followed by a crescent moon.\p"
+	.string "“The sun goes first.\n"
+	.string "The moon walks last.\l"
+	.string "Let either wield the cosmos,\n"
+	.string "and the way will open.”$"
+
+MeteorFalls_B1F_2R_Text_MarksResolve:
+	.string "The marks answer the presence of\n"
+	.string "your POKéMON with a low rumble…$"
+
+MeteorFalls_B1F_2R_Text_DoorOpened:
+	.string "The stone split open, revealing\n"
+	.string "a hidden chamber beyond!$"
+
+MeteorFalls_B1F_2R_Text_MarksOpened:
+	.string "The marks have done their part.\n"
+	.string "The way lies open.$"
